msgid "FontForge does not support type2 programs embedded in CFF DICT INDICES."
msgstr "FontForge は CFF DICT INDEXに埋め込まれた Type2 プログラムはサポートしていません。"

msgid ""
"FontForge does not update this window when a change is made to the font.\n"
